<view class="content-shell">
  <view class="business-hero">
    <view class="cc-h1">
      一键冒烟运行
    </view>
    <view class="cc-p">
      生成或转换完成的项目会自带 Batch 46 冒烟包。在这里选中项目即可一键跑起来：
          自动灌入一次性种子数据、探活、跑冒烟断言，免费额度到期后自动停止服务并清空临时数据。
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="business-form">
    <label class="business-form-grid">
      <text>
        项目引用（相对 ELMOS_SMOKE_PROJECTS_ROOT 的路径）
      </text>
      <input value="{{ draft }}" placeholder="例如 java-to-python/orders-service" maxlength="{{ 180 }}" bindchange="handleChangeInput0" />
    </label>
    <view class="business-actions">
      <button class="button button-primary" type="button" disabled="{{ !(/^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9._/-]{2,180}$/i.test(draft.trim()) && !draft.includes(&quot;..&quot;)) }}" bindtap="handleClickButton1">
        载入冒烟包
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <block wx:if="{{ projectRef }}">
    <smoke-run-button project-ref="{{ projectRef }}" />
  </block>
</view>
